From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:00:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/25] Release channel, no update checks, bug reports to
 Ibasho

The Ibasho channel counts as a release channel, so the menu bar has the
normal colour instead of the red of Linden Lab's test builds (black on a
grid not run by Linden Lab, as for Linden Lab's release viewer).

Ibasho never asks Linden Lab's update service (VVM) about updates, never
offers one and never downloads anything by itself; release notes don't
pop up; Preferences says there are no updates instead of showing update
settings; a grid that asks for a newer viewer gets "look for a newer
Ibasho", not Linden Lab's download page. build_data.json names Ibasho as
the channel base and has no update service.

Help > Report Bug opens Ibasho's issue tracker (ReportBugURL, a
placeholder until the project is published); Linden Lab's bug-reporting
links are gone from the hidden Deprecated menu; the freeze and
missing-file messages no longer send people to Linden Lab's support.
